| !Run for !YSFlight (M1 test build: the console server, no window yet).
| Lines starting with | are comments.
Set YSFlight$Dir <Obey$Dir>

| The program is an Absolute file with UnixLib inside it, but it needs
| UnixLib's SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport (both from PackMan).
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error YSFlight needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error YSFlight needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| UnixLib's thread timer module, for the simulator's threads. It must be
| loaded before the program starts.
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere System:Modules.PThrTicker Then RMLoad System:Modules.PThrTicker
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 RMLoad <YSFlight$Dir>.PThrTicker

| The task window's slot must hold the whole program (about 6 MB); the
| heap goes in dynamic areas ("YSFlight Heap").
TaskWindow "Obey <YSFlight$Dir>.Tests" -wimpslot 16384K -name "YSFlight M1 tests"
